                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46700' id='17' type-v2='text' w='22299' x='77167' y='800'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>This dashboard enables users to observe the </run>
                    <run bold='true'>frontend performance of individual Vendors</run>
                    <run>. 
It does not show overall platform conversion

The focus is on mCVR3, thus the metrics are on VIEW basis. This means that there can be multiple views associated with single session or user.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>List views =</run>
                    <run> Times a Vendor was seen in the &apos;Restaurant Search&apos; section of Mjam.
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Menu Views =</run>
                    <run> Times a Vendor&apos;s Menu section has been seen.
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Checkout Views</run>
                    <run> = Times users have seen the checkout page of that Vendor.
</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Transactions</run>
                    <run> = Times a transaction was completed.

</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>mCVR3</run>
                    <run>:
This dashboard looks at mCVR3 step of the funnel as follows:
(Checkout Views)/(Menu Views)
Same as in the product definitions of DH.
</run>
                    <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://product.deliveryhero.net/global-analytics/documentation/definitions-of-analytics-metricskpis/#2.1&amp;quot;'>https://product.deliveryhero.net/global-analytics/documentation/definitions-of-analytics-metricskpis/#2.1</run>
                    <run>&#10;&#10;Filters: &#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Platform</run>
                    <run> = Shows which device/channel these views were generated from</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='5200' id='13' mode='checkdropdown' name='WeeklyCVRList ' param='[federated.1p5zm8a0h24eaj1btjxvy0cdc51w].[none:city:nk]' show-apply='true' type-v2='filter' values='relevant' w='22299' x='77167' y='52700'>
                  <zone-style>
